{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.HeckeSandwichReduces"],"declarations":26,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd_pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd_pn","kind":"theorem","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L236-L250","doc":"**Two nucleon types.**  If block `k` is the proton word when `isP k` and the\nneutron word otherwise, the product of block traces is `P_p ^ Z * P_n ^ N`, with\n`Z` and `N` the numbers of proton and neutron blocks among `0 … n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd_words","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd_words","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L225-L234","doc":"**Nucleon blocks.**  Block `k` is the word `word k` placed on strands\n`3k, 3k+1, 3k+2` (letters at generator index `≤ 1`).  The trace of the product of\nall blocks is the product of the traces of the words, each read at offset `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L218-L223","doc":"**On every braided tower**, the trace of a product of blocks in consecutive\nstrand windows is the product of the block traces. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd_of_disjointBlock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_blockProd_of_disjointBlock","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L206-L216","doc":"**Core form**: given the disjoint-block law, the trace of a product of blocks in\nconsecutive strand windows is the product of the block traces. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.blockProd_mem_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.blockProd_mem_H","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L196-L203","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.blockProd_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.blockProd_succ","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L191-L193","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.blockProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.blockProd","kind":"def","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L187-L188","doc":"`blk 0 * blk 1 * ⋯ * blk n`, multiplied left to right. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_wordVal_shift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_wordVal_shift","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L179-L183","doc":"**A word's trace does not depend on its offset.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_wordVal_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.tr_wordVal_succ","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L166-L177","doc":"**Shifting a word by one strand does not change its trace.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_word","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L157-L164","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_letter","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L149-L155","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_g","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L121-L147","doc":"**The shift relation** `c g_t = g_{t+1} c` for `s ≤ t` and `t + 1 < s + m`,\nfrom the braid and far-commutation relations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.g_commute_cyc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.g_commute_cyc","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L114-L119","doc":"A generator above the range of `cyc s m` commutes with it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cycInv_mul_cyc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cycInv_mul_cyc","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L106-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_cycInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc_mul_cycInv","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L101-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cycInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cycInv","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L96-L99","doc":"`cycInv s m = ginv_{s+m-1} * ⋯ * ginv_s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.cyc","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L91-L94","doc":"`cyc s m = g_s * g_{s+1} * ⋯ * g_{s+m-1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_mem_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_mem_shifted","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L84-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.letterVal_mem_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.letterVal_mem_shifted","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L79-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_mem_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_mem_H","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L72-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.letterVal_mem_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.letterVal_mem_H","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L65-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.ginv_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.ginv_letter","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L58-L63","doc":"The inverse generator is the affine letter `(i, -h, 1)` once `g_i` satisfies\n`g² = h g + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_cons","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L55-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal_nil","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.wordVal","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L50-L51","doc":"A word of letters at offset `off`, multiplied left to right. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.letterVal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedBlockShiftTrace.letterVal","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/BraidedBlockShiftTrace.lean#L47-L48","doc":"The letter `(i, a, b)` placed at offset `off`: `a • 1 + b • g_{off+i}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}